{"suttaId":"ps3.10","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Paṭis","vriCode":"s0517m.mul","paras":[2016,2044],"vripara":"40"},"segments":{"ps3.10:0.3":"Mātikākathā","ps3.10:1.1":"Nicchāto [nicchāto muccatīti (syā.)], mokkho vimokkho, vijjāvimutti, adhisīlaṃ, adhicittaṃ, adhipaññā, passaddhi, ñāṇaṃ, dassanaṃ visuddhi [suddhi (syā.)] nekkhammaṃ, nissaraṇaṃ paviveko, vossaggo, cariyā, jhānavimokkho, bhāvanā, adhiṭṭhānaṃ, jīvitaṃ.","ps3.10:2.1":"<b>Nicchāto</b>ti nekkhammena kāmacchandato nicchāto, abyāpādena byāpādato nicchāto … pe …","ps3.10:2.2":"paṭhamena jhānena nīvaraṇehi nicchāto … pe …","ps3.10:2.3":"arahattamaggena sabbakilesehi nicchāto.","ps3.10:3.1":"<b>Mokkho vimokkho</b>ti nekkhammena kāmacchandato muccatīti –","ps3.10:3.2":"mokkho vimokkho.","ps3.10:3.3":"Abyāpādena byāpādato muccatīti –","ps3.10:3.4":"mokkho vimokkho … pe …","ps3.10:3.5":"paṭhamena jhānena nīvaraṇehi muccatīti –","ps3.10:3.6":"mokkho vimokkho … pe …","ps3.10:3.7":"arahattamaggena sabbakilesehi muccatīti –","ps3.10:3.8":"mokkho vimokkho.","ps3.10:4.1":"<b>Vijjāvimuttī</b>ti nekkhammaṃ vijjatīti vijjā, kāmacchandato muccatīti vimutti.","ps3.10:4.2":"Vijjanto muccati, muccanto vijjatīti –","ps3.10:4.3":"vijjāvimutti.","ps3.10:4.4":"Abyāpādo [abyāpādaṃ (syā.)] vijjatīti vijjā, byāpādato vimuccatīti vimutti.","ps3.10:4.5":"Vijjanto muccati, muccanto vijjatīti –","ps3.10:4.6":"vijjāvimutti … pe …","ps3.10:4.7":"arahattamaggo vijjatīti vijjā, sabbakilesehi muccatīti vimutti.","ps3.10:4.8":"Vijjanto muccati, muccanto vijjatīti –","ps3.10:4.9":"vijjāvimutti.","ps3.10:5.1":"<b>Adhisīlaṃ adhicittaṃ adhipaññā</b>ti nekkhammena kāmacchandaṃ, saṃvaraṭṭhena sīlavisuddhi, avikkhepaṭṭhena cittavisuddhi, dassanaṭṭhena diṭṭhivisuddhi.","ps3.10:5.2":"Yo tattha saṃvaraṭṭho, ayaṃ adhisīlasikkhā.","ps3.10:5.3":"Yo tattha avikkhepaṭṭho, ayaṃ adhicittasikkhā.","ps3.10:5.4":"Yo tattha dassanaṭṭho, ayaṃ adhipaññāsikkhā.","ps3.10:5.5":"Abyāpādena byāpādaṃ saṃvaraṭṭhena sīlavisuddhi … pe …","ps3.10:5.6":"arahattamaggena sabbakilese saṃvaraṭṭhena sīlavisuddhi, avikkhepaṭṭhena cittavisuddhi.","ps3.10:5.7":"Dassanaṭṭhena diṭṭhivisuddhi.","ps3.10:5.8":"Yo tattha saṃvaraṭṭho, ayaṃ adhisīlasikkhā.","ps3.10:5.9":"Yo tattha avikkhepaṭṭho, ayaṃ adhicittasikkhā.","ps3.10:5.10":"Yo tattha dassanaṭṭho, ayaṃ adhipaññāsikkhā.","ps3.10:6.1":"<b>Passaddhī</b>ti nekkhammena kāmacchandaṃ paṭippassambheti, abyāpādena byāpādaṃ paṭippassambheti … pe …","ps3.10:6.2":"arahattamaggena sabbakilese paṭippassambheti.","ps3.10:7.1":"<b>Ñāṇan</b>ti kāmacchandassa pahīnattā nekkhammaṃ ñātaṭṭhena ñāṇaṃ;","ps3.10:7.2":"byāpādassa pahīnattā abyāpādo ñātaṭṭhena ñāṇaṃ … pe …","ps3.10:7.3":"sabbakilesānaṃ pahīnattā arahattamaggo ñātaṭṭhena ñāṇaṃ.","ps3.10:8.1":"<b>Dassanan</b>ti kāmacchandassa pahīnattā nekkhammaṃ diṭṭhattā dassanaṃ.","ps3.10:8.2":"Byāpādassa pahīnattā abyāpādo diṭṭhattā dassanaṃ … pe …","ps3.10:8.3":"sabbakilesānaṃ pahīnattā arahattamaggo diṭṭhattā dassanaṃ.","ps3.10:9.1":"<b>Visuddhī</b>ti kāmacchandaṃ pajahanto nekkhammena visujjhati.","ps3.10:9.2":"Byāpādaṃ pajahanto abyāpādena visujjhati … pe …","ps3.10:9.3":"sabbakilese pajahanto arahattamaggena visujjhati.","ps3.10:10.1":"<b>Nekkhamman</b>ti kāmānametaṃ nissaraṇaṃ, yadidaṃ nekkhammaṃ.","ps3.10:10.2":"Rūpānametaṃ nissaraṇaṃ, yadidaṃ āruppaṃ.","ps3.10:10.3":"Yaṃ kho pana kiñci bhūtaṃ saṅkhataṃ paṭiccasamuppannaṃ, nirodho tassa nekkhammaṃ.","ps3.10:10.4":"Byāpādassa abyāpādo nekkhammaṃ.","ps3.10:10.5":"Thinamiddhassa ālokasaññā nekkhammaṃ … pe …","ps3.10:10.6":"sabbakilesānaṃ arahattamaggo nekkhammaṃ.","ps3.10:11.1":"<b>Nissaraṇan</b>ti kāmānametaṃ nissaraṇaṃ, yadidaṃ nekkhammaṃ.","ps3.10:11.2":"Rūpānametaṃ nissaraṇaṃ, yadidaṃ āruppaṃ.","ps3.10:11.3":"Yaṃ kho pana kiñci bhūtaṃ saṅkhataṃ paṭiccasamuppannaṃ, nirodho tassa nissaraṇaṃ.","ps3.10:11.4":"Kāmacchandassa nekkhammaṃ nissaraṇaṃ.","ps3.10:11.5":"Byāpādassa abyāpādo nissaraṇaṃ … pe …","ps3.10:11.6":"sabbakilesānaṃ arahattamaggo nissaraṇaṃ.","ps3.10:12.1":"<b>Paviveko</b>ti kāmacchandassa nekkhammaṃ paviveko … pe …","ps3.10:12.2":"sabbakilesānaṃ arahattamaggo paviveko.","ps3.10:13.1":"<b>Vossaggo</b>ti nekkhammena kāmacchandaṃ vossajjatīti – vossaggo.","ps3.10:13.3":"Abyāpādena byāpādaṃ vossajjatīti – vossaggo … pe …","ps3.10:13.5":"arahattamaggena sabbakilese vossajjatīti – vossaggo.","ps3.10:14.1":"<b>Cariyā</b>ti kāmacchandaṃ pajahanto nekkhammena carati.","ps3.10:14.2":"Byāpādaṃ pajahanto abyāpādena carati … pe …","ps3.10:14.3":"sabbakilese pajahanto arahattamaggena carati.","ps3.10:15.1":"<b>Jhānavimokkho</b>ti nekkhammaṃ jhāyatīti –","ps3.10:15.2":"jhānaṃ.","ps3.10:15.3":"Kāmacchandaṃ jhāpetīti –","ps3.10:15.4":"jhānaṃ.","ps3.10:15.5":"Jhāyanto muccatīti –","ps3.10:15.6":"jhānavimokkho.","ps3.10:15.7":"Jhāpento muccatīti –","ps3.10:15.8":"jhānavimokkho.","ps3.10:15.9":"Jhāyantīti dhammā.","ps3.10:15.10":"Jhāpentīti kilese.","ps3.10:15.11":"Jhāte ca jhāpe ca jānātīti –","ps3.10:15.12":"jhānajhāyī [jhānavimokkho (syā.) aṭṭhakathā oloketabbā].","ps3.10:15.13":"Abyāpādo jhāyatīti jhānaṃ.","ps3.10:15.14":"Byāpādaṃ jhāpetīti –","ps3.10:15.15":"jhānaṃ … pe …","ps3.10:15.16":"ālokasaññā jhāyatīti –","ps3.10:15.17":"jhānaṃ.","ps3.10:15.18":"Thinamiddhaṃ jhāpetīti –","ps3.10:15.19":"jhānaṃ … pe …","ps3.10:15.20":"arahattamaggo jhāyatīti –","ps3.10:15.21":"jhānaṃ.","ps3.10:15.22":"Sabbakilese jhāpetīti –","ps3.10:15.23":"jhānaṃ.","ps3.10:15.24":"Jhāyanto muccatīti –","ps3.10:15.25":"jhānavimokkho.","ps3.10:15.26":"Jhāpento muccatīti –","ps3.10:15.27":"jhānavimokkho.","ps3.10:15.28":"Jhāyantīti –","ps3.10:15.29":"dhammā.","ps3.10:15.30":"Jhāpentīti –","ps3.10:15.31":"kilese.","ps3.10:15.32":"Jhāte ca jhāpe ca jānātīti –","ps3.10:15.33":"jhānajhāyī.","ps3.10:16.1":"<b>Bhāvanā adhiṭṭhānaṃ jīvitan</b>ti kāmacchandaṃ pajahanto nekkhammaṃ bhāvetīti –","ps3.10:16.2":"bhāvanāsampanno.","ps3.10:16.3":"Nekkhammavasena cittaṃ adhiṭṭhātīti –","ps3.10:16.4":"adhiṭṭhānasampanno.","ps3.10:16.5":"Svāyaṃ evaṃ bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno samaṃ jīvati, no visamaṃ;","ps3.10:16.6":"sammā jīvati, no micchā;","ps3.10:16.7":"visuddhaṃ jīvati, no kiliṭṭhanti –","ps3.10:16.8":"ājīvasampanno.","ps3.10:16.9":"Svāyaṃ evaṃ bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno ājīvasampanno yaññadeva parisaṃ upasaṅkamati –","ps3.10:16.10":"yadi khattiyaparisaṃ yadi brāhmaṇaparisaṃ yadi gahapatiparisaṃ yadi samaṇaparisaṃ –","ps3.10:16.11":"visārado upasaṅkamati amaṅkubhūto.","ps3.10:16.12":"Taṃ kissa hetu?","ps3.10:16.13":"Tathā hi so bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno ājīvasampanno.","ps3.10:17.1":"Byāpādaṃ pajahanto abyāpādaṃ bhāvetīti –","ps3.10:17.2":"bhāvanāsampanno … pe …","ps3.10:17.3":"thinamiddhaṃ pajahanto ālokasaññaṃ bhāvetīti –","ps3.10:17.4":"bhāvanāsampanno … pe …","ps3.10:17.5":"uddhaccaṃ pajahanto avikkhepaṃ bhāvetīti –","ps3.10:17.6":"bhāvanāsampanno … pe …","ps3.10:17.7":"vicikicchaṃ pajahanto dhammavavatthānaṃ bhāvetīti –","ps3.10:17.8":"bhāvanāsampanno … pe …","ps3.10:17.9":"avijjaṃ pajahanto vijjaṃ bhāvetīti –","ps3.10:17.10":"bhāvanāsampanno … pe …","ps3.10:17.11":"aratiṃ pajahanto pāmojjaṃ bhāvetīti –","ps3.10:17.12":"bhāvanāsampanno … pe …","ps3.10:17.13":"nīvaraṇe pajahanto paṭhamaṃ jhānaṃ bhāvetīti –","ps3.10:17.14":"bhāvanāsampanno … pe …","ps3.10:17.15":"sabbakilese pajahanto arahattamaggaṃ bhāvetīti –","ps3.10:17.16":"bhāvanāsampanno.","ps3.10:17.17":"Arahattamaggavasena cittaṃ adhiṭṭhātīti –","ps3.10:17.18":"adhiṭṭhānasampanno.","ps3.10:17.19":"Svāyaṃ evaṃ bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno samaṃ jīvati, no visamaṃ;","ps3.10:17.20":"sammā jīvati, no micchā;","ps3.10:17.21":"visuddhaṃ jīvati, no kiliṭṭhanti –","ps3.10:17.22":"ājīvasampanno.","ps3.10:17.23":"Svāyaṃ evaṃ bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno ājīvasampanno yaññadeva parisaṃ upasaṅkamati –","ps3.10:17.24":"yadi khattiyaparisaṃ yadi brāhmaṇaparisaṃ yadi gahapatiparisaṃ yadi samaṇaparisaṃ –","ps3.10:17.25":"visārado upasaṅkamati amaṅkubhūto.","ps3.10:17.26":"Taṃ kissa hetu?","ps3.10:17.27":"Tathā hi so bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno ājīvasampannoti.","ps3.10:17.28":"Mātikākathā niṭṭhitā.","ps3.10:17.29":"Paññāvaggo tatiyo.","ps3.10:17.30":"Tassuddānaṃ –","ps3.10:18.1":"Paññā iddhi abhisamayo,","ps3.10:18.2":"viveko cariyapañcamo;","ps3.10:18.3":"Pāṭihāri samasīsi,","ps3.10:18.4":"satipaṭṭhānā vipassanā;","ps3.10:18.5":"Tatiye paññāvaggamhi,","ps3.10:18.6":"mātikāya ca te dasāti.","ps3.10:19.1":"Mahāvaggo yuganaddho,","ps3.10:19.2":"paññāvaggo ca nāmato;","ps3.10:19.3":"Tayova vaggā imamhi [tivaggo yassa vikkhepo (syā. ka.)],","ps3.10:19.4":"paṭisambhidāpakaraṇe.","ps3.10:20.1":"Anantanayamaggesu,","ps3.10:20.2":"gambhīro sāgarūpamo;","ps3.10:20.3":"Nabhañca tārakākiṇṇaṃ,","ps3.10:20.4":"thūlo jātassaro yathā;","ps3.10:20.5":"Kathikānaṃ visālāya,","ps3.10:20.6":"yogīnaṃ ñāṇajotananti.","ps3.10:20.7":"Paṭisambhidāmaggapāḷi niṭṭhitā."},"unsure":["ps3.10:13.1","ps3.10:13.3","ps3.10:13.5"],"attha":{"book":"Paṭis-a","bookName":"Paṭisambhidāmagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0517a.att","from":2483,"to":2487,"paras":[{"para":2483,"vripara":"40","refs":["ps3.10:1"],"lines":["Idāni mahāthero vipassanākathānantaraṃ sakale paṭisambhidāmagge niddiṭṭhe samathavipassanāmagganibbānadhamme ākāranānattavasena nānāpariyāyehi thometukāmo <b>nicchāto</b>tiādīni ekūnavīsati mātikāpadāni uddisitvā tesaṃ niddesavasena mātikākathaṃ nāma kathesi.","Tassā ayaṃ apubbatthānuvaṇṇanā.","Mātikāya tāva <b>nicchāto</b>ti amilāto.","Sabbepi hi kilesā pīḷāyogato milātā, rāgopi tāva nirantarappavatto sarīraṃ dahati, kiṃ panaññe kilesā.","“Tayome, bhikkhave, aggī rāgaggi dosaggi mohaggī”ti (itivu.93; dī. ni.3.305) pana kilesanāyakā tayo eva kilesā vuttā, taṃsampayuttāpi pana dahantiyeva.","Evaṃ chātakilesābhāvato nicchāto.","Ko so?","Vimokkhasambandhena vimokkhoti daṭṭhabbo.","Muccatīti <b>mokkho</b>.","Vimuccatīti <b>vimokkho</b>ti attho.","Idamekaṃ mātikāpadaṃ.","<b>Vijjāvimuttī</b>ti vijjāyeva vimutti.","Idamekaṃ mātikāpadaṃ.","<b>Jhānavimokkho</b>ti jhānameva vimokkho.","Idamekaṃ mātikāpadaṃ.","Sesāni ekekānevāti evaṃ ekūnavīsati mātikāpadāni."],"lineRefs":[["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"],["ps3.10:1"]]},{"para":2484,"vripara":"41","refs":["ps3.10:2","ps3.10:4"],"lines":["<b>Nekkhammena kāmacchandato nicchāto</b>ti nekkhammena kāmacchandato apetattā kāmacchandato nikkileso yogī.","Tena paṭiladdhaṃ nekkhammampi nicchāto nikkileso vimokkho.","Evaṃ sesesupi.","<b>Nekkhammena kāmacchandato muccatīti vimokkho</b>ti nekkhammena kāmacchandato yogī muccatīti taṃ nekkhammaṃ vimokkhoti attho.","Evaṃ sesesupi.","<b>Vijjatīti vijjā</b>ti sabhāvato vijjati atthi upalabbhatīti vijjā nāmāti attho.","Atha vā sabhāvajānanatthaṃ paṭipannehi yogīhi sabhāvaṃ vedīyati jānīyatīti vijjā nāmāti attho.","Atha vā visesalābhatthaṃ paṭipannehi yogīhi vedīyati paṭilābhīyatīti vijjā nāmāti attho.","Atha vā attanā vinditabbaṃ bhūmiṃ vindati labhatīti vijjā nāmāti attho.","Atha vā sabhāvadassanahetuttā sabhāvaṃ viditaṃ karotīti vijjā nāmāti attho.","<b>Vijjanto muccati, muccanto vijjatī</b>ti yathāvutto dhammo yathāvuttenatthena vijjamāno yathāvuttato muccati, yathāvuttato muccamāno yathāvuttenatthena vijjatīti vijjāvimutti nāmāti attho."],"lineRefs":[["ps3.10:2"],["ps3.10:2"],["ps3.10:2"],["ps3.10:2"],["ps3.10:2"],["ps3.10:4"],["ps3.10:4"],["ps3.10:4"],["ps3.10:4"],["ps3.10:4"],["ps3.10:4"]]},{"para":2485,"vripara":null,"refs":["ps3.10:5","ps3.10:6","ps3.10:7","ps3.10:8","ps3.10:9"],"lines":["<b>Kāmacchandaṃ saṃvaraṭṭhenā</b>ti kāmacchandanivāraṇaṭṭhena taṃ nekkhammaṃ <b>sīlavisuddhi</b> nāmāti attho.","Taṃyeva avikkhepahetuttā avikkhepaṭṭhena <b>cittavisuddhi</b>.","Dassanahetuttā dassanaṭṭhena <b>diṭṭhivisuddhi</b>.","Sesesupi eseva nayo.","<b>Paṭippassambhetī</b>ti nekkhammādinā kāmacchandādikaṃ yogāvacaro paṭippassambhetīti nekkhammādiko dhammo passaddhi nāmāti attho.","<b>Pahīnattā</b>ti tena tena pahānena pahīnattā.","<b>Ñātaṭṭhena ñāṇan</b>ti jhānapaccavekkhaṇāvasena vipassanāvasena maggapaccavekkhaṇāvasena ñātaṭṭhena nekkhammādikaṃ ñāṇaṃ nāmāti attho.","<b>Diṭṭhattā dassanan</b>ti etthāpi eseva nayo.","<b>Visujjhatī</b>ti yogī, nekkhammādikā <b>visuddhi</b>."],"lineRefs":[["ps3.10:5"],["ps3.10:5"],["ps3.10:5"],["ps3.10:5"],["ps3.10:6"],["ps3.10:7"],["ps3.10:7"],["ps3.10:8"],["ps3.10:9"]]},{"para":2486,"vripara":null,"refs":["ps3.10:10","ps3.10:12","ps3.10:14"],"lines":["Nekkhammaniddese nekkhammaṃ alobhattā kāmarāgato nissaṭanti <b>nissaraṇaṃ</b>.","Tato nikkhantanti <b>nekkhammaṃ</b>.","“Rūpānametaṃ nissaraṇaṃ yadidaṃ nekkhamman”ti vuccamāne āruppavisesassa adissanato visesassa dassanatthaṃ aññattha vuttapāṭhakkameneva <b>yadidaṃ āruppan</b>ti vuttaṃ.","Tañca āruppaṃ rūpato nikkhantattā nekkhammaṃ nāmāti adhikāravaseneva vuttaṃ hoti.","<b>Bhūtan</b>ti uppādasamāyogadīpanaṃ.","<b>Saṅkhatan</b>ti paccayabalavisesadassanaṃ.","<b>Paṭiccasamuppannan</b>ti paccayasamāyogepi paccayānaṃ abyāpārabhāvadassanaṃ.","<b>Nirodho tassa nekkhamman</b>ti nibbānaṃ tato saṅkhatato nikkhantattā tassa saṅkhatassa nekkhammaṃ nāma.","Āruppassa ca nirodhassa ca gahaṇaṃ aññattha pāṭhe vuttakkameneva kataṃ.","“Kāmacchandassa nekkhammaṃ nekkhamman”ti vuccamāne punaruttaṃ hoti.","Nekkhammavacaneneva ca tassa nekkhammasiddhīti taṃ avatvā sesanekkhammameva vuttaṃ.","Taṃ ujukameva.","Nissaraṇaniddesepi imināva nayena attho veditabbo.","Nissaraṇīyā dhātuyo panettha ujukameva nekkhammanti vuttaṃ.","<b>Paviveko</b>ti pavivittabhāvo nekkhammādikoyeva.","<b>Vosajjatī</b>ti yogī, nekkhammādayo <b>vosaggo</b>.","Nekkhammaṃ pavattento yogī nekkhammena caratīti vuccati.","Taṃ pana nekkhammaṃ <b>cariyā</b>.","Esa nayo sesesupi.","Jhānavimokkhaniddese vattabbaṃ vimokkhakathāyaṃ vuttaṃ.","Kevalaṃ tattha “jānātīti jhānavimokkho”ti (paṭi. ma.1.217) vuttaṃ, idha pana “jānātīti, jhāyatī”ti puggalādhiṭṭhānāva desanā katāti ayaṃ viseso."],"lineRefs":[["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:10"],["ps3.10:12"],["ps3.10:12"],["ps3.10:12"],["ps3.10:14"],["ps3.10:14"],["ps3.10:14"],["ps3.10:14"]]},{"para":2487,"vripara":"42","refs":["ps3.10:14","ps3.10:16"],"lines":["Bhāvanādhiṭṭhānajīvitaniddese ca puggalādhiṭṭhānā desanā katā.","Dhammato pana <b>bhāvanā</b> nāma nekkhammādayova.","<b>Adhiṭṭhānaṃ</b> nāma nekkhammādivasena patiṭṭhāpitacittameva.","<b>Jīvitaṃ</b> nāma nekkhammādivasena patiṭṭhāpitacittassa sammāājīvo nāma.","Ko so sammāājīvo nāma?","Micchājīvā virati, dhammena samena paccayapariyesanavāyāmo ca.","Tattha <b>samaṃ jīvatī</b>ti samaṃ jīvitaṃ jīvati, bhāvanapuṃsakavacanaṃ vā, samena jīvatīti vuttaṃ hoti.","<b>No visaman</b>ti “samaṃ jīvatī”ti vuttasseva atthassa paṭisedhavasena avadhāraṇaṃ kataṃ.","<b>Sammā jīvatī</b>ti ākāranidassanaṃ.","<b>No micchā</b>ti tasseva niyamanaṃ.","<b>Visuddhaṃ jīvatī</b>ti sabhāvavisuddhiyā visuddhaṃ jīvitaṃ jīvati.","<b>No kiliṭṭhan</b>ti tasseva niyamanaṃ.","<b>Yaññadevā</b>tiādīhi yathāvuttānaṃ tissannaṃ sampadānaṃ ānisaṃsaṃ dasseti.","Tattha <b>yaññadevā</b>ti yaṃ yaṃ eva.","<b>Khattiyaparisan</b>ti khattiyānaṃ sannipātaṃ.","So hi samantato sīdanti ettha akatabuddhinoti parisāti vuccati.","Eseva nayo itarattaye.","Khattiyādīnaṃyeva āgamanasampattiyā ñāṇasampattiyā ca samannāgatattā tāsaṃyeva catassannaṃ gahaṇaṃ, na suddaparisāya.","<b>Visārado</b>ti tīhi sampadāhi sampanno vigatasārajjo, nibbhayoti attho.","<b>Amaṅkubhūto</b>ti asaṅkucito na nittejabhūto.","<b>Taṃ kissa hetū</b>ti taṃ visāradattaṃ kena hetunā kena kāraṇena hotīti ceti attho.","Idāni <b>tathā hī</b>ti tassa kāraṇavacanaṃ.","Yasmā evaṃ tisampadāsampanno, tasmā “visārado hotī”ti visāradabhāvassa kāraṇaṃ dassetvā niṭṭhapesīti."],"lineRefs":[["ps3.10:14"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"],["ps3.10:16"]]}],"wordLinks":[["ps3.10:1.1","nicchāto",0,0],["ps3.10:1.1","nicchāto",0,2],["ps3.10:1.1","mokkho",0,8],["ps3.10:1.1","vimokkho",0,9],["ps3.10:1.1","vijjāvimuttī",0,11],["ps3.10:1.1","jhānavimokkho",0,13],["ps3.10:2.1","nekkhammena kāmacchandato nicchāto",1,0],["ps3.10:4.1","vijjatīti vijjā",1,5],["ps3.10:4.2","vijjatīti vijjā",1,5],["ps3.10:4.4","vijjatīti vijjā",1,5],["ps3.10:4.5","vijjatīti vijjā",1,5],["ps3.10:4.8","vijjatīti vijjā",1,5],["ps3.10:4.2","vijjanto muccati muccanto vijjatī",1,10],["ps3.10:4.5","vijjanto muccati muccanto vijjatī",1,10],["ps3.10:4.8","vijjanto muccati muccanto vijjatī",1,10],["ps3.10:5.1","kāmacchandaṃ saṃvaraṭṭhenā",2,0],["ps3.10:5.1","sīlavisuddhi",2,0],["ps3.10:5.5","sīlavisuddhi",2,0],["ps3.10:5.1","cittavisuddhi",2,1],["ps3.10:5.5","cittavisuddhi",2,1],["ps3.10:5.1","diṭṭhivisuddhi",2,2],["ps3.10:5.7","diṭṭhivisuddhi",2,2],["ps3.10:6.1","paṭippassambhetī",2,4],["ps3.10:7.1","pahīnattā",2,5],["ps3.10:7.2","pahīnattā",2,5],["ps3.10:7.1","ñātaṭṭhena ñāṇaṃ",2,6],["ps3.10:7.2","ñātaṭṭhena ñāṇaṃ",2,6],["ps3.10:8.1","diṭṭhattā dassanaṃ",2,7],["ps3.10:8.2","diṭṭhattā dassanaṃ",2,7],["ps3.10:9.1","visuddhi",2,8],["ps3.10:9.1","visujjhatī",2,8],["ps3.10:9.2","visujjhatī",2,8],["ps3.10:10.1","nissaraṇaṃ",3,0],["ps3.10:10.2","nissaraṇaṃ",3,0],["ps3.10:10.1","nekkhammaṃ",3,1],["ps3.10:10.3","nekkhammaṃ",3,1],["ps3.10:10.4","nekkhammaṃ",3,1],["ps3.10:10.5","nekkhammaṃ",3,1],["ps3.10:10.2","yadidaṃ āruppaṃ",3,2],["ps3.10:10.3","bhūtaṃ",3,4],["ps3.10:10.3","saṅkhataṃ",3,5],["ps3.10:10.3","paṭiccasamuppannaṃ",3,6],["ps3.10:10.3","nirodho tassa nekkhammaṃ",3,7],["ps3.10:12.1","paviveko",3,14],["ps3.10:14.1","cariyā",3,17],["ps3.10:16.1","bhāvanā",4,1],["ps3.10:16.5","bhāvanā",4,1],["ps3.10:16.9","bhāvanā",4,1],["ps3.10:16.13","bhāvanā",4,1],["ps3.10:16.1","adhiṭṭhānaṃ",4,2],["ps3.10:16.3","adhiṭṭhānaṃ",4,2],["ps3.10:16.5","adhiṭṭhānaṃ",4,2],["ps3.10:16.9","adhiṭṭhānaṃ",4,2],["ps3.10:16.13","adhiṭṭhānaṃ",4,2],["ps3.10:16.1","jīvitaṃ",4,3],["ps3.10:16.5","samaṃ jīvatī",4,6],["ps3.10:16.5","no visamaṃ",4,7],["ps3.10:16.6","sammā jīvatī",4,8],["ps3.10:16.6","no micchā",4,9],["ps3.10:16.7","visuddhaṃ jīvatī",4,10],["ps3.10:16.7","no kiliṭṭhaṃ",4,11],["ps3.10:16.9","yaññadevā",4,12],["ps3.10:16.9","yaññadevā",4,13],["ps3.10:16.9","khattiyaparisaṃ",4,14],["ps3.10:16.9","visārado",4,18],["ps3.10:16.9","amaṅkubhūto",4,19],["ps3.10:16.12","taṃ kissa hetū",4,20],["ps3.10:16.13","tathā hī",4,21]],"before":[{"para":2480,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Vipassanākathāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2481,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Mātikākathā"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2482,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Mātikākathāvaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}],"after":[{"para":2488,"vripara":null,"lines":["Saddhammappakāsiniyā paṭisambhidāmagga-aṭṭhakathāya"]},{"para":2489,"vripara":null,"lines":["Mātikākathāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."]},{"para":2490,"vripara":null,"lines":["Paññāvaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."]},{"para":2491,"vripara":null,"lines":["Niṭṭhitā cūḷavaggassa apubbatthānuvaṇṇanā."]},{"para":2492,"vripara":null,"lines":["Ettāvatā ca tivaggasaṅgahitassa"]},{"para":2493,"vripara":null,"lines":["Samatiṃsakathāpaṭimaṇḍitasspaṭisambhidāmaggassa atthavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā hotīti."]},{"para":2494,"vripara":null,"lines":["Nigamanakathā"]},{"para":2495,"vripara":null,"lines":["Mahāvaggo majjhimo ca, cūḷavaggo ca nāmato;"]},{"para":2496,"vripara":null,"lines":["Tayo vaggā idha vuttā, pamāṇapaṭipāṭiyā."]},{"para":2497,"vripara":null,"lines":["Vagge vagge dasa dasa, kathā yā tā udīritā;"]},{"para":2498,"vripara":null,"lines":["Uddānagāthā sabbāsaṃ, imā tāsaṃ yathākkamaṃ."]},{"para":2499,"vripara":null,"lines":["Ñāṇaṃ diṭṭhi ānāpānaṃ, indriyaṃ vimokkhapañcamaṃ;"]},{"para":2500,"vripara":null,"lines":["Gati kammaṃ vipallāso, maggo maṇḍoti tā dasa."]},{"para":2501,"vripara":null,"lines":["Yuganaddhasaccabojjhaṅgā, mettā virāgapañcamā;"]},{"para":2502,"vripara":null,"lines":["Paṭisambhidā dhammacakkaṃ, lokuttarabalasuññatā."]},{"para":2503,"vripara":null,"lines":["Paññā iddhi abhisamayo, viveko cariyapañcamo;"]},{"para":2504,"vripara":null,"lines":["Pāṭihīraṃ samasīsa-sati vipassanamātikā."]},{"para":2505,"vripara":null,"lines":["Yo so sugatasutānaṃ, adhipatibhūtena bhūtahitaratinā;"]},{"para":2506,"vripara":null,"lines":["Therena thiraguṇavatā, vutto <b>paṭisambhidāmaggo</b>."]},{"para":2507,"vripara":null,"lines":["Tassa <b>tthavaṇṇanā</b> yā, pubbaṭṭhakathānayaṃ tathā yuttiṃ;"]},{"para":2508,"vripara":null,"lines":["Nissāya mayāraddhā, niṭṭhānamupāgatā esā."]},{"para":2509,"vripara":null,"lines":["Yaṃ taṃ uttaramantī, mantiguṇayuto yuto ca saddhāya;"]},{"para":2510,"vripara":null,"lines":["Kārayi mahāvihāre, pariveṇamanekasādhuguṇaṃ."]},{"para":2511,"vripara":null,"lines":["Therenettha nivasatā, samāpitāyaṃ <b>mahābhidhānena</b>;"]},{"para":2512,"vripara":null,"lines":["Tatiye vasse cutito, moggallānassa bhūpatino."]},{"para":2513,"vripara":null,"lines":["Samayaṃ anulomentī, therānaṃ theravādadīpānaṃ;"]},{"para":2514,"vripara":null,"lines":["Niṭṭhaṃ gatā yathāyaṃ, aṭṭhakathā lokahitajananī."]},{"para":2515,"vripara":null,"lines":["Dhammaṃ anulomentā, attahitaṃ parahitañca sādhentā;"]},{"para":2516,"vripara":null,"lines":["Niṭṭhaṃ gacchantu tathā, manorathā sabbasattānaṃ."]},{"para":2517,"vripara":null,"lines":["<b>Saddhammapakāsiniyā,</b> aṭṭhakathāyettha gaṇitakusalehi;"]},{"para":2518,"vripara":null,"lines":["Gaṇitā tu bhāṇavārā, viññeyyā aṭṭhapaññāsa."]},{"para":2519,"vripara":null,"lines":["Ānuṭṭhubhena assā, chandobandhena gaṇiyamānā tu;"]},{"para":2520,"vripara":null,"lines":["Cuddasasahassasaṅkhā, gāthāyo pañca ca satāni."]},{"para":2521,"vripara":null,"lines":["Sāsanaciraṭṭhitatthaṃ, lokahitatthañca sādarena mayā;"]},{"para":2522,"vripara":null,"lines":["Puññaṃ imaṃ racayatā, yaṃ pattamanappakaṃ vipulaṃ."]},{"para":2523,"vripara":null,"lines":["Puññena tena loko, saddhammarasāyanaṃ dasabalassa;"]},{"para":2524,"vripara":null,"lines":["Upabhuñjitvā vimalaṃ, pappotu sukhaṃ sukhenevāti."]},{"para":2525,"vripara":null,"lines":["Saddhammappakāsinī nāma"]},{"para":2526,"vripara":null,"lines":["Paṭisambhidāmaggappakaraṇassa aṭṭhakathā niṭṭhitā."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
